#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every one of the 10,024 parents still holds 8 to 95 words — the entry frames, read out of the JVM by name — and seven in ten were born three to five times bigger than a tail. That size is warm-up code: with C2 disabled (`-XX:TieredStopAtLevel=1`) the same park freezes 1,184 words instead of 298; in a normal run, frames logged at freeze time are mostly interpreted at 3.8 s, all C1 by 4.2 s, and C2 by 4.4 s, by which point the chunks have stopped being fat. The pool's threads are all promoted in those first seconds, and *whatever they were holding then is what they keep*."
msgstr "这10,024个“父母”中的每一个仍然持有8到95个单词——即通过名称从JVM中读取的条目帧——其中七成在诞生时比一个“尾部”大3到5倍。 这种大小属于预热代码：当禁用 C2（ `-XX:TieredStopAtLevel=1` ）时，同一内存池会冻结 1,184 个字，而非 298 个； 在正常运行中，冻结时记录的帧大多在3.8秒时被解释执行，所有C1在4.2秒时被解释执行，C2在4.4秒时被解释执行，此时这些代码块已不再“臃肿”。池中的线程都在最初的几秒内被提升， *它们当时持有的内容就是它们一直保留的内容* 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "And it is held whatever the pool is doing: at the instant of the 1 GB dump, half the pooled threads were sitting idle in the pool, and their chunks are the same size as the busy ones'. It is the cost of the pool existing, not working."
msgstr "而且无论线程池处于何种状态，情况都是如此：在生成 1 GB 转储文件的瞬间，一半的线程池线程处于空闲状态，且它们的内存块大小与正在运行的线程相同。这就是线程池存在的成本，而非其运行所产生的成本。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Where the 60 MB Lives"
msgstr "60 MB 藏在哪里"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sixty megabytes that never die is old-generation occupancy, and the old generation records where the start-up burst — 10,000 connections opening and sending at once — leaves each arm:"
msgstr "“永不消失的60兆字节”是旧代的占用量，而旧代会记录启动时的大流量突发——即10,000个连接同时建立并发送数据——从每个分支离开的位置："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "after the start-up burst, 1 GB heap"
msgstr "启动阶段内存激增后，堆大小为 1 GB"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "old gen occupied, of 683 MB"
msgstr "旧版本已占用 683 MB"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "old gen free"
msgstr "上一代免费"

#. mt: deepl
